{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52188","headline":"颂六十二首 十三 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"含识皆畏死，有命惧嶮危。\n如鱼困池涸，难逢流水希。\n亲疎皆父母，何得不悲时（一作「辄相欺」）。\n何慈救厄苦（一作「慈悲救危苦」）。\n福报自然随。\n（见同书卷八《放生部》。\n注一作者，爲《法苑珠林》卷八二之异文。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52188.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52188","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}